,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":344,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:11:11Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-08-22T23:37:47Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T22:55:55Z","closed_at":"2026-09-01T22:55:43Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122729","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122729","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122729.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122729.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-01T22:55:43Z"},"body":"- Prerequisite https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120609\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nWhen using RetargetModifier3D, if you want to scale a model’s skin using `skin_scale`, you’ll need to scale the skin of the `OriginalSkeleton` because the `GeneralSkeleton` does not have a skin. However, doing so causes a significant misalignment between the `GeneralSkeleton` and the `OriginalSkeleton`, making it difficult to view.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"600\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e6918960-23d9-459d-b54c-08011ee300d1\" />\r\n\r\nIf you apply `skin_scale` and `BoneSpreader` only to `GeneralSkeleton`, only the position animation will be retargeted, and the skin scaling will be ignored.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"600\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1825bc07-2c17-439c-be23-1f2612bdaf6e\" />\r\n\r\nWe will add an option to RetargetModifier to copy the `skin_scale` from the GeneralSkeleton to the OriginalSkeleton. This automates the coordinate transformation, allowing `skin_scale` to be applied to both. The process is as follows:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"400\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4208ed43-8cbe-426f-aac0-24ec704fb0bd\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"600\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/00a2c56e-84e8-41dd-997c-aec8a8e1c4bd\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"543\" height=\"310\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dc16368b-a8ff-4cda-98ee-4b207fc76da1\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122729/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122729/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}